<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is moving to block exports of chemicals used in Myanmar rare-earth mining and is planning bans on such chemicals, while simultaneously promoting cross-border rail freight and border trade to access global markets. Security actions include a Chanthaburi man confessing to an acid attack on his wife, an American man dying after provoking an MMA fighter, and police seizing RM2.5 million worth of syabu near the Kelantan border; Cambodian officials also protested a Thai military visit and new bunker construction along the contested border. Ukrainian Oplot tanks were reported to perform better than Chinese VT‑4s in Thai clashes. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPRGI2eFNYQm1uMms3d1FabVI2VW05aFRvQTEwajF0TkxmaEp4R3dZLVJoVnpVMk1uVTUzN0FPWFNmeEU1NUxRaVRkOHg2bzNKU0JJT0xXSmhneDIxb1d0RlR5NHhzVEVwN3lNRGpkaDUzaWZxM3dMMkJwRDNQVWhhakxQbTNETm54d0ZZU1JPWVhDQVBqdUlxN0w0Yk9hamZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontier Myanmar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQM1RWVmN0TXRoNWpyYUtkQXNxVDM5UzFZeDVmWmpEdU1nQ0kzLWszVEgxWDg5UURxRmJVZ1NTUW9Ma19LWTVwOXB5YXZMVHB6ZW1zY05pTHVMT2JwaTh2Q3RqZ0pYZU9sU21OZzJHZ0dUUHd1Z1o4NThxOGt4SHNmeDRnSlYtMDFQQUxUS0lra1kxZlJCeTFzM21CdENUN1hvSHo1Mk9jUTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5ya2ZNLURrdHdGWWkzOWJ0Y3NNWmx6X2ZIOUhZcjdsRXQ5NzNlWUotTTFEM3B5Rnhqaldsakl5TFZ5bTFGdkpleXFMMGZCZVAzWXI0LTMxTURua3FhLTg1TXJVLXYyQUdQeTJLSEU3U29yZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;MySinchew&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQY295WkxBSjBhRmR0cDA5cFJsSHM0TUZ5VkhTeHVIRHRqa2RKck9TUjlCQ25tdld0aDVzMkIyM2U3bThSN04xR3NJeEJmZkd5V0tCVHNudUtyYl82V29DVmxlN